<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>BBC Chinese</title><subtitle type="html">BBC Chinese - BBC News , 中文 - 主頁</subtitle><id>https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:15:20Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss.xml" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/trad" /><link rel="via" href="https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>洪水來襲前幾分鐘，這位尼泊爾校長及時疏散了900名學生</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cdr7yd0zyg1o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T11:56:25Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cdr7yd0zyg1o/trad--4af713ab9cd2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cdr7yd0zyg1o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">洪水來襲前，尼泊爾一家中學正在上課，校長在10分鐘內果斷疏散了全校900名師生。就在撤離後，校舍瞬間被洪水和瓦礫淹沒。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國審查西藏口岸遭洪災衝擊畫面，當地災民情況我們所知甚少</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cnvl38dyyq0o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-30T12:37:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cnvl38dyyq0o/trad--5ba777fb8c53.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cnvl38dyyq0o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一些關於這場致命山洪暴發最驚人的畫面，中國官方媒體未對公眾播放。</summary></entry><entry><title>塔吉克斯坦年輕人之間緣何興起「漢語熱」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5yj5eg69jjo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:15:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T09:41:10Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5yj5eg69jjo/trad--2ac81966f858.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5yj5eg69jjo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">直到幾年前，英語仍被塔吉克年輕人視為最重要的外語，但隨著中國在中亞地區的經濟影響力不斷擴大，漢語成為了對年輕一代更具吸引力的選擇。</summary></entry><entry><title>為何台灣公視屢陷預算爭議？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c4gjd85e03xo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T00:15:40Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c4gjd85e03xo/trad--0d28ff3e55f9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c4gjd85e03xo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">作為開播28年的公共媒體，為何台灣公視反覆陷入預算爭議？預算及董事會人事為何多次成為台灣朝野政黨交鋒的焦點？</summary></entry><entry><title>美國NASA全新超強望遠鏡將改寫我們對宇宙的理解</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqlwd2w1vnlo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:15:08Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T13:34:48Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqlwd2w1vnlo/trad--d1936a91f9c0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqlwd2w1vnlo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">羅曼太空望遠鏡（Nancy Grace Roman Space Telescope）8月30日從佛羅里達州肯尼迪太空中心發射升空。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國：氣候變暖導致尼泊爾—西藏泥石流災難</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0ren4z009qo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-30T05:58:22Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0ren4z009qo/trad--70e8a078ebfd.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0ren4z009qo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中方調查專家稱，造成泥石流的冰岩崩從發生到衝擊西藏吉隆口岸僅約6到7分鐘。</summary></entry><entry><title>衛星圖像揭示村莊災情的嚴重程度</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx2zp5q4gnjo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-30T03:53:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx2zp5q4gnjo/trad--d2ba8fc245e8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx2zp5q4gnjo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">衛星對比圖像曝光尼泊爾洪災的嚴峻災情。許多村莊、橋樑和西藏邊境的重要過境點被毀滅性的洪水沖毀。</summary></entry><entry><title>是甚麼導致西藏致命泥石流？科學家分析來龍去脈</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckgxvnv51x5o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-27T16:52:46Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckgxvnv51x5o/trad--9a32fa3f8744.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckgxvnv51x5o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國地質調查局（USGS）表示，這場災難的成因是一次冰川崩塌，但專家仍在調查洪水如何在下游發展並造成嚴重影響。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國總理赴泥石流災場前線意味著什麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c980env4n78o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-28T11:41:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c980env4n78o/trad--92b9a4244bc4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c980env4n78o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在中國，災難應對往往也帶有政治訊號。尤其是中共中央總書記作出「重要指示」，或總理、副總理親赴現場，通常意味著北京把事件視為需要高度關注和統籌應對的重大危機。</summary></entry><entry><title>西方官員：俄羅斯加大強硬言論，但仍避免與北約爆發戰爭</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cy8zyg119dyo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T00:15:46Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cy8zyg119dyo/trad--a5843b6f2cb5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cy8zyg119dyo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">西方官員稱，普京當局可能會繼續對北約成員國採取「混合行動」攻勢，但不會直接動武。</summary></entry><entry><title>韓國統一教領袖韓鶴子涉貪罪成，判囚兩年</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c980y406995o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:15:11Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T09:35:51Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c980y406995o/trad--5fdac2194aba.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c980y406995o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">法院表示，韓鶴子曾向前總統尹錫悅的妻子金建希，送贈兩個Chanel手袋及一條鑽石項鏈，總值8,000萬韓圜（57,900美元；42,500英鎊）。</summary></entry><entry><title>她放下演藝事業，回愛丁堡拯救家裏的中餐館</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/czjzdlvly70o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T00:15:53Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/czjzdlvly70o/trad--d26df99023e1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/czjzdlvly70o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">母親經營了30年的餐廳正在走下坡。因此，賀灕灑暫停了自己的演藝事業，回到蘇格蘭的家裏試一把。</summary></entry><entry><title>澳洲每年上演全球最大型烏賊交配活動——今年盛況不再</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c62ewvv46v6o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-30T06:45:53Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c62ewvv46v6o/trad--1d6673be8c2a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c62ewvv46v6o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">官方數據稱今年只有1811隻烏賊前來交配，比去年下降了97%，這可能會對明年的族群數量產生影響。</summary></entry><entry><title>Dolly Parton的父親生前不識字，於是她給數百萬孩子寄上書本</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5ydw7pv2nzo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-30T11:03:44Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5ydw7pv2nzo/trad--bd8f565dd259.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5ydw7pv2nzo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">全球各地的家庭分享了帕頓想像圖書館提供的免費書籍如何幫助他們的孩子。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國科技公司新嘗試：「性愛」機器人，瞄準「陪伴經濟」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9v9pkd7ejpo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-28T08:51:11Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9v9pkd7ejpo/trad--7169231e3977.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9v9pkd7ejpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">近年來，中國的「陪伴經濟」異軍突起，AI和機器人技術的高速發展亦給這個市場注入諸多新的可能。</summary></entry><entry><title>「烤過頭」了嗎？機械人薄餅製造商為何難逃失敗命運</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c20ln8nrzn4o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:15:15Z</updated><published>2026-08-30T00:14:20Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c20ln8nrzn4o/trad--9c9773f68546.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c20ln8nrzn4o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">接二連三的失敗，令外界對機械人全面接管披薩餐廳製作流程的前景失去信心。</summary></entry><entry><title>特朗普簽署行政命令，將「安大略湖」更名為「美國湖」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c804ld7kl93o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:15:17Z</updated><published>2026-08-28T05:35:04Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c804ld7kl93o/trad--e416ff37728a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c804ld7kl93o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">特朗普簽署這項行政命令之際，美加貿易談判已於上週稍後時間宣告破裂。</summary></entry><entry><title>前線報導：尼泊爾洪災逾900人罹難  民眾絕望尋找失蹤親人</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvgy4vd7ny4o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:15:20Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T10:56:56Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvgy4vd7ny4o/trad--4aff2d5aaa54.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvgy4vd7ny4o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">尼泊爾上周遭遇毀滅性洪災，已有超過900人死亡，仍有4200人失蹤。有許多人在街頭一張張查看尋找到的遺體照片，絕望地尋找失聯的親人；也有數百人被困隧道，至今生死未卜。</summary></entry><entry><title>香港卡牌熱潮：一張卡如何從遊戲變資產成為「紙上黃金」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm2q7zj89qyo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-28T02:06:41Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm2q7zj89qyo/trad--cd50cdc3b685.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm2q7zj89qyo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">近年全球掀起一波集換式卡牌熱潮，除了玩樂以外，更有不少人用來投資炒賣。美國市場分析公司統計，2025年全球集換式卡牌市場規模達到約78億美元，到2031年有望升至128.6億美元。一張卡由遊戲變成資產，成為「紙上黃金」。BBC中文拆解卡牌熱潮的起因以及熱潮延續的可能性。</summary></entry><entry><title>追溯西藏尼泊爾致命山洪如何發生</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c980e6r9jzgo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-28T08:14:57Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c980e6r9jzgo/trad--5899c86a1140.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c980e6r9jzgo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一場災難性山洪和泥石流席捲了尼泊爾與中國西藏交界的邊境地區，吞噬了城鎮、沖毀了橋梁，並導致兩地數百人死亡。BBC Verify利用已核實的影片和衛星圖像，追蹤這場致命山洪的發展路徑。</summary></entry><entry><title>「結束一黨專政」：為何令支聯會煽動顛覆政權罪成？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c1w1r9d8gn2o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-21T12:59:23Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c1w1r9d8gn2o/trad--ab596511f987.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c1w1r9d8gn2o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">已解散的香港支聯會及其前正副主席，在8月21日被裁定國安法下的「煽動顛覆國家政權罪」罪名成立。三名前領袖李卓人、鄒幸彤與何俊仁，將面對最高十年監禁。曾經連續30年在香港主辨全球最大的六四燭光晚會，支聯會的「結束一黨專政」綱領成為本案核心及定罪關鍵。</summary></entry><entry><title>「蟑螂人民黨」的崛起：印度Z世代到底在抗議什麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c1l136ry802o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-21T11:05:58Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c1l136ry802o/trad--363a07f0c8e3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c1l136ry802o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一句侮辱，演變成一場反抗。從網路玩笑到全國抗議，這場由印度Z世代推動的運動，成為納倫德拉·莫迪執政以來最嚴峻的挑戰之一。</summary></entry><entry><title>霍爾木茲海峽動盪，如何在巴拿馬運河引發中美角力？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cdj013krm3no/trad#4</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-21T13:39:35Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cdj013krm3no/trad--77ccfd7692d6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cdj013krm3no/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國和中國再次就巴拿馬運河問題交鋒。這條戰略水道約佔全球海運貿易量5%，而美國近40%的集裝箱運輸都經過這裏。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國稱數十國助中國避特朗普關稅</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq6d1y1212po/trad#4</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-14T05:11:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq6d1y1212po/trad--ca9553d15fcf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq6d1y1212po/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國一份新報告稱，中國透過關稅較低的國家轉運貨物，以規避較高關稅。</summary></entry><entry><title>特習會後美中再現摩擦　「建設性穩定」能否撐到九月？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqx7z51qvpgo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-04T00:01:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqx7z51qvpgo/trad--6863f100f319.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqx7z51qvpgo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">關稅、台灣、安全議題再起摩擦，特習會後的美中「建設性穩定」還能持續多久？</summary></entry><entry><title>中美俄的太空攻防戰：衛星如何成為現代戰爭的第一擊？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cgljn380r59o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-01T09:56:01Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cgljn380r59o/trad--77d395c5dbdc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cgljn380r59o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在現代戰爭中，環繞地球運行的人造衛星幾乎未曾受到波及；但到了21世紀，太空或許已不再是安全的避風港。</summary></entry><entry><title>特朗普政府禁止中國人形機械人進口 北京批「泛化國家安全」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3ekn91y5j5o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-07-29T11:14:21Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3ekn91y5j5o/trad--e9e1ec045b93.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3ekn91y5j5o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國和中國正陷入一場爭奪全球機械人與人工智能領導地位的競賽。</summary></entry><entry><title>女性罵髒話很低劣嗎？莫迪言論引燃「蟑螂人民黨」後續辯論</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5y7w1xgp2ro/trad#5</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-28T02:49:24Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5y7w1xgp2ro/trad--9f506de00e3c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5y7w1xgp2ro/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">印度在野黨議員拉胡爾·甘地的言論再次引發有關性別差異的辯論，焦點在於人們對辱罵總理莫迪言論的反應是否因性別而有所不同。</summary></entry><entry><title>台灣藝人涉「潑油」損日本國寶，如何牽動台日關係？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cje82403k49o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-25T05:42:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cje82403k49o/trad--122004fb460f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cje82403k49o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">蔡宜臻被捕後坦承犯行，供稱自己「會對令我感動的事物淋油祈禱，因此應該有在佛足石上淋油」。外界討論「潑油」行為是否屬基督教的宗教儀式，也關注事情對台日關係的影響。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國再次制裁伊朗能成功向德黑蘭政權施壓嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckg8v11revgo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-26T07:35:58Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckg8v11revgo/trad--7f1c5faef617.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckg8v11revgo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國稱新的制裁是「經濟D日（economic D-Day）」，但德黑蘭領導人以前也曾挺過了制裁。</summary></entry><entry><title>在西南英格蘭的角落，編織手工給移英港人女士們另一個家</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvgyewnred2o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-24T06:15:27Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvgyewnred2o/trad--626c929bc985.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvgyewnred2o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">位於布里斯托爾的「編織微笑」小組旨在促進移英港人的交流互動。</summary></entry><entry><title>慈善？演戲？科茨沃爾德？哈利和梅根會怎樣重建英國生活？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvgyr5y5exro/trad#5</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-25T08:03:21Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvgyr5y5exro/trad--fa4299165593.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvgyr5y5exro/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">這對夫婦即將返回英國——他們在這裡將專注什麼也逐漸明朗起來。</summary></entry><entry><title>「在我眼中它就是黃金」：一張卡如何從遊戲工具變資產？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0j3w0wxj18o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-28T04:32:04Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0j3w0wxj18o/trad--34e32e54f479.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0j3w0wxj18o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">市場分析公司統計，全球集換式卡牌（TCG）市場規模到2031年有望升至128.6億美元。原本屬於小朋友的遊戲工具，何以突然變成「紙上黃金」？</summary></entry><entry><title>「甲醛白菜」再現中國：食品安全監管的盲區在哪裡？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ce3rz7xxr04o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-26T11:07:16Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ce3rz7xxr04o/trad--4f747496d312.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ce3rz7xxr04o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">近日，中國河北省被揭發收購商為達到保鮮效果，將大白菜蘸取工業甲醛，再裝車運輸到外地，事件引發官方及輿論高度關注。</summary></entry><entry><title>人形機器人以外，一場中國機器革命正靜悄悄地發生</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c804e143e9yo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-25T08:51:14Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c804e143e9yo/trad--2e16c6d7a6b9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c804e143e9yo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中國工廠裡有超過兩百萬台機器人正在工作——而且它們的數量還在快速增長。</summary></entry><entry><title>普京首登擇捉島：俄羅斯與中國共同牽制日本？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5y7l9dng2eo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-25T09:28:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5y7l9dng2eo/trad--9945452187c8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5y7l9dng2eo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">這是普京執政逾25年來首次踏足「北方四島」（俄稱南千島群島）之一。當前正值俄羅斯遭遇來自烏克蘭一波接一波的無人機攻勢之際，普京為何要在此時親赴遠東登島？</summary></entry><entry><title>「我就是個普通人」：中國出入境新規上路前，那些早已受困的民眾</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ce3q0yd25j9o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-20T00:07:18Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ce3q0yd25j9o/trad--c17da898eda4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ce3q0yd25j9o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從9月15日開始，中國出入境新規將開始實施，不少民眾擔心出境自由受限。但早在新規出台前，從公務員、國企人員到普通民眾，已經有不少人因為各種原因被限制出境。</summary></entry><entry><title>「因古老而安全」：為何舊技術有時更能防範黑客攻擊？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5yd3r9rzyzo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-28T09:14:33Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5yd3r9rzyzo/trad--a299c0c67684.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5yd3r9rzyzo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">對黑客攻擊的擔憂，促使一些人轉而使用那些被新一代網絡罪犯忽略的技術。</summary></entry><entry><title>這些藥物讓人更難以應對高溫</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cg49yzyv4yko/trad#7</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-27T00:02:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cg49yzyv4yko/trad--0630c93feef5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cg49yzyv4yko/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一些最常獲處方的藥物，包括用於治療抑鬱症、注意力不足過動症（ADHD）和高血壓的藥物，可能會增加脫水及其他與高溫相關疾病的風險。</summary></entry><entry><title>厄爾尼諾增強：全球海洋溫度創有紀錄以來新高</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cn459py3371o/trad#7</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-26T00:22:13Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cn459py3371o/trad--d8eef1a94a58.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cn459py3371o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">歐洲哥白尼氣候變化服務的薩曼莎·伯吉斯博士表示，這項紀錄是「另一個表明海洋正面臨越來越大壓力的清晰訊號」。</summary></entry><entry><title>我六歲就來月經了，但醫生們也不知道為什麼</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cz0z77y4dj2o/trad#7</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-25T00:10:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cz0z77y4dj2o/trad--29655ccc1d5a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cz0z77y4dj2o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">性早熟會導致兒童過早出現第二性徵，而且對女孩的影響比例明顯較高。</summary></entry><entry><title>先天黑色素細胞痣：「皮膚使我獨一無二，我正學習接納它。」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0j3pwj2x6eo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-08-31T16:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-08-26T00:22:07Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0j3pwj2x6eo/trad--c5b4c8898719.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0j3pwj2x6eo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">28歲的勞拉·凱利（Laura Kelly）天生患有先天性黑色素細胞痣（CMN），並在嬰兒時期接受了14次手術。</summary></entry></feed>
